1
00:00:06,637 --> 00:00:09,965
The hall is warm, the brass notes hum,

2
00:00:10,264 --> 00:00:13,844
I lose myself in the rumba’s pulse.

3
00:00:14,116 --> 00:00:17,424
A sacred movement inside my skin,

4
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:21,441
Where every step feels pure and wild.

5
00:00:22,715 --> 00:00:26,325
Let the fever rise, let the rhythm speak,

6
00:00:26,384 --> 00:00:30,129
In the pulse of the dance, I am whole and free.

7
00:00:30,326 --> 00:00:33,591
My body moves like a living flame,

8
00:00:34,083 --> 00:00:37,882
Dancing for no one, claiming my name.

9
00:00:39,397 --> 00:00:42,894
I let the music take control,

10
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:46,491
Alive and whole in the rhythm's sway.

11
00:00:46,632 --> 00:00:50,276
Then came his hand, possessive, heavy,

12
00:00:50,482 --> 00:00:53,853
Breaking the trance with a sudden chill.

13
00:00:55,673 --> 00:00:59,290
Cold fingers pressing against my waist,

14
00:00:59,523 --> 00:01:02,784
Crossing the line, invading my space.

15
00:01:02,992 --> 00:01:06,350
The warmth inside turns sharp and slow,

16
00:01:06,608 --> 00:01:10,823
As safety melts into calculated frost.

17
00:01:11,908 --> 00:01:15,474
Now the fever dies, as the shadow speaks,

18
00:01:15,488 --> 00:01:18,999
In the grip of his touch, I am no longer free.

19
00:01:19,321 --> 00:01:22,870
My burning warmth turns to icy steel,

20
00:01:23,172 --> 00:01:26,892
Locking away all the passion I feel.

21
00:01:28,414 --> 00:01:31,724
I step back slow, I sever the tie,

22
00:01:32,073 --> 00:01:35,359
Look him in the eye and say goodbye.

23
00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:39,009
This floor is not a cage for his desire,

24
00:01:39,359 --> 00:01:42,275
He cannot put out my inner fire.

25
00:01:57,524 --> 00:02:00,889
I break the hold, I walk out the door,

26
00:02:01,172 --> 00:02:04,547
I won't be trapped on this stage anymore.

27
00:02:04,592 --> 00:02:08,045
Let the silence fall, as my spirit speaks,

28
00:02:08,126 --> 00:02:12,231
Stepping into the night, I am truly free.

29
00:02:13,657 --> 00:02:17,640
He tried to claim what belonged to me,

30
00:02:18,008 --> 00:02:21,211
But the dance is my own,

31
00:02:21,631 --> 00:02:24,712
But the dance is my own,

32
00:02:24,801 --> 00:02:28,083
But the dance is my own,

